<footer>
  <div>Cultivate diligently</div>
  <div id="local-time"></div>
  <p class="p3-note">Colors on this website make use of the wide P3 color space to produce rich, deep, amazing color when viewed in a web browser that supports the <code>color(display-p3 R G B)</code> CSS function, like for example Safari, in combination with a wide-gamut display.</p>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    padding: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0;
  }
  #local-time {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .p3-note {
    display: none;
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .p3-note code {
    font-family: inherit;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  @supports (color: color(display-p3 1 0 0)) {
    .p3-note {
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>